Description:
- One Pump For All: A master pump that replaces all your inflation/deflation pumps;
- Inflate & Deflate with Ease: 9 pump modes to handle anything, anywhere;
- Fast Performance: Inflate your air tent in just 60 seconds;
- Dual Power Options: Use it corded for all-day work or go cordless with a powerful 7,500mAh battery;
- Smart Presets: 9 intelligent presets automatically stop at the optimal pressure for perfect results.

12V Cordless Rotary Tool Kit
- High-Performance Brushless Motor: Powerful motor delivering 35000RPM for challenging tasks;

- Seamless Speed Adjustments: Offers smooth speed adjustments for versatile applications;

- Long Battery Life: 3000mAh battery provides 120 minutes of use, with quick TYPE-C charging;

- Beginner-Friendly: LED light, dust cover, and one-click lock designed for beginners;

- Essential Accessories Included: The set includes 37 accessories for diverse DIY tasks.
